@startuml "Téléchargement des billets"

title Téléchargement des billets

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

User -> Frontend: Télécharger billets
Frontend -> API: GET /api/tickets/{ticketId}/download
API -> Auth: Vérifier token et propriété
Auth --> API: access granted
API -> TicketSvc: generateTicketPDF(ticketId)
TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT ticket WITH qr_code
DB --> TicketSvc: ticket data
TicketSvc -> TicketSvc: Générer PDF avec QR
TicketSvc --> API: PDF stream
API --> Frontend: PDF file
Frontend --> User: Téléchargement PDF

@enduml